    "Native/WASM comparison uses the shared storage adapter; browser DOM and persistent localStorage were not tested.",
    "The visual review covers the 18 final captured scenes, not every card portrait or exact original-PC UI fidelity.",
    "Audio, multiplayer and Timeline are excluded."
  ]
}
